xtras/bb74863f3934ffb890e2c7c38f4dbd3c.mp4?t=1768662224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/c39534e45b5bb7846a669925c993171f.avif?t=1768662224\" width=780 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >THE GREAT SASSANELLI\u2019s evocative prose offers a unique cast of fully realised NPCS, reams of sparkling dialogue, and an abundance of carefully crafted, well-written stories set in a war-torn world \u2013 some light-hearted, some tragic, some both.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/e0953e3de1ae6873a52f3588cd2a4958.avif?t=1768662224\" width=780 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your travels, you will meet a number of Gifted Performers you can hire \u2013 meticulously crafted NPCs with their own goals, interests, sympathies, and aversions, each coming with their own special act, story arc, and gameplay perks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/5429a42b1387b7c76d44d1485823fda9.avif?t=1768662224\" width=780 height=510 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/02e125c2e08ea36d737ab725e17a6747.avif?t=1768662224\" width=780 height=72 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of choices allow the player to pace, branch, roleplay and control a multitude of enthralling storylines, some of them tough and morally complex. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/6b2e73f8cc30ccd9ac0