ts of the early 1900s, the unique, painterly art style immerses you even deeper in the peculiar, magical-realist world of THE GREAT SASSANELLI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/41b36d6e8f2f6af1a0f6913accdbc596.poster.avif?t=1768662224\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/41b36d6e8f2f6af1a0f6913accdbc596.webm?t=1768662224\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/extras/41b36d6e8f2f6af1a0f6913accdbc596.mp4?t=1768662224\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Forking Paths Gardening Interactive"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2195490/9a749ab4815f1c05dbc91bec0cf3e5e0bc99a494/header.jpg?t=1768662224","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS x 11.0 or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 3 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"name":"The Great Sassanelli \u2013 An Interactive Novel","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 1.2GHz processor (Intel Core i5 and up)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 Capable<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available spac